cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this library, please cite the paper it formalizes (the mathematics is due to
  its authors) and, if you wish, this formalization.
title: "AbstractVoronoi: a Lean 4 formalization of abstract Voronoi diagrams"
abstract: >-
  A formalization in Lean 4 with Mathlib of Definition 1 to Theorem 10 of Klein, Langetepe
  and Nilforoushan, "Abstract Voronoi diagrams revisited" (Computational Geometry 42 (2009)
  885-902): systems of bisecting curves and their admissibility axioms, Voronoi regions and
  diagrams, the structure theorem for neighbourhoods of a point of a Jordan curve, and the
  fact that the diagram of n sites is a finite plane graph of size O(n).  It includes a
  self-contained development of the planar topology the paper uses, built on a Lean
  formalization of the Jordan-Schoenflies theorem.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Oliver Burwitz"
    given-names: "Nicolau"
license: Apache-2.0
# Replace the placeholder with the address of the repository once it is published.
repository-code: "https://github.com/OliverNicolau/AVD-lean"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formalization
  - abstract Voronoi diagrams
  - computational geometry
  - plane topology
